title: A Foreign Ministry Line
subtitle: [+ foreign_authority_label +] — use the portfolio without claiming powers held elsewhere.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and foreign_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_foreign_ministry_line_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_foreign_ministry_line_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/presidential-channel.webp

= A Foreign Ministry Line

[? if foreign_authority_role = "junior_mfa": The prime minister and coalition
programme bound the ministry. An initiative can work, be narrowed or be
overruled; holding the portfolio is not the same as leading government.?]
[? if foreign_authority_role = "lead_mfa": Lewica holds both cabinet leadership
and Foreign Affairs. It may initiate policy, but it also owns delivery and any
failure.?]

- @eastern_coalition
- @continental_network
- @publish_doctrine

@eastern_coalition
title: Build an eastern coalition around Ukraine and enlargement
subtitle: Turn Polish geography into European leverage.
on-arrival: eu_influence += 4; eu_eastern_coalition += 5; ukraine_solidarity += 4; foreign_pressure -= 2; left_atlanticist_dissent += 1; foreign_ministry_override_risk += 2 if foreign_authority_role = "junior_mfa"; foreign_policy_responsibility += 3 if foreign_authority_role = "lead_mfa"; news_headline = "Warsaw convenes an eastern coalition for Ukraine and European enlargement"

The ministry joins security, reconstruction and accession into one regional
position. KO cannot object to the direction, so it objects to the fact that
the Left announced it first.

- #poland_card_finish


@continental_network
title: Open a Warsaw-Berlin-Paris social channel
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity; junior ministers risk a cabinet override.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The ministry lacks capacity for a sustained initiative.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; germany_relation += 3; france_relation += 3; eu_influence += 3; eu_left_network += 4; foreign_ministry_override_risk += 3 if foreign_authority_role = "junior_mfa"; foreign_policy_responsibility += 3 if foreign_authority_role = "lead_mfa"; news_headline = "Warsaw opens a continental channel on work, energy and democratic security"

Ministers, unions and municipal leaders meet around industrial policy,
workers' rights and resilience. It is foreign policy conducted through
relationships that survive a single Council meeting.

- #poland_card_finish


@publish_doctrine
title: Publish a restrained, autonomous doctrine
subtitle: No resource or budget cost. Define the line without manufacturing a summit.
on-arrival: public_trust += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; foreign_pressure -= 1; us_ambassador_channel += 1; foreign_ministry_override_risk += 2 if foreign_authority_role = "junior_mfa"; foreign_policy_responsibility += 2 if foreign_authority_role = "lead_mfa"; news_headline = "The Foreign Ministry publishes a doctrine of solidarity without blank cheques"

The text commits Poland to Ukraine, Europe and treaty allies while reserving
democratic scrutiny over escalation and arms policy. It is sober enough to be
ignored by television and precise enough to constrain the next crisis.

- #poland_card_finish
